fixture tech11_toss_teleport_and_jump_same_frame
doc Task 3 review round 2, M4: BUILD.md s5 feel rules "Input is read every frame, before physics, and acted on the same frame", "No input ever waits for an animation"; s5 Jump "Double jump: 1 per airtime"; s6 Ember Toss "press again to teleport to it". Toss and jump pressed together in the air: the teleport goes first and the air jump goes from where it lands.
room test/flat
spawn 400 544
frames 70
input
  # The ember flies up-right and stops in the air after its 40 frames (about 684, 261).
  0 U R toss
  # A ground jump, then, airborne with the air jump in hand, toss and jump on the same frame.
  30..43 jump
  44 -
  45 toss jump
  46..60 jump
end
expect
  at 44 state=air air_jumps=1
  at 45 event.teleport=1
  # Either the jump fires out of the teleport (rising), or the air jump is still there.
  never 45..46 air_jumps=0 vy>=0
end
